    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: (c) $C_2$</strong></p><p>Without $2s{-}2p$ mixing, MO order is: $\\sigma2s, \\sigma^*2s, \\sigma2p_z, \\pi2p$. For $C_2$ (8 valence electrons): $\\sigma2s^2\\ \\sigma^*2s^2\\ \\sigma2p_z^2\\ \\pi2p_x^1\\ \\pi2p_y^1$ → 2 unpaired electrons → paramagnetic. (With normal mixing, $C_2$ would be diamagnetic.)</p>",
