    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: $sp^3$</strong></p><p>In ammonium ion $NH_4^+$, nitrogen has 4 bond pairs (bonded to 4 H atoms) and 0 lone pairs → 4 electron domains → $sp^3$ hybridization → tetrahedral geometry with $109.5°$ bond angles.</p>",
