    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: Planar (trigonal planar)</strong></p><p>$CH_3^+$ (methyl carbocation) has carbon with 3 bond pairs and 0 lone pairs → $sp^2$ hybridization → trigonal planar shape with $120°$ bond angles. The empty $p$ orbital is perpendicular to the molecular plane.</p>",
