    "number": "73",
    "type": "fib",
    "text": "When ${N}_{2}$ goes to ${N}_{2}^{+}$ the $N-N$ bond distance _______ and when ${O}_{2}$ goes to ${O}_{2}^{+}$ the $O-O$ bond distance_____________ .",
