    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: (b)</strong></p><p>Properties that increase down the alkaline earth group: atomic radius, ionic radius, electropositive character, reducing power. IE and electronegativity decrease. Density doesn't follow a regular trend. The question asks about the property that specifically increases with atomic number.</p>",
