    "solution": "<p><strong>Model Answer:</strong></p><p>Triple superphosphate from fluorapatite: Step 1: $Ca_3(PO_4)_2 \\cdot CaF_2 + 3H_2SO_4 → 3CaSO_4 + 2H_3PO_4 + CaF_2$ (make phosphoric acid). Step 2: $Ca_3(PO_4)_2 + 4H_3PO_4 → 3Ca(H_2PO_4)_2$ (triple superphosphate). Overall: Fluorapatite + H₂SO₄ → phosphoric acid → reacts with more rock phosphate.</p>",
    "needsManualReview": false,
