    "text": "The structure of a peptide is given below. If the absolute values of the net charge of the peptide at $pH=2,pH=6$ , and $pH=11$ are $\\left( {z}_{1} \\right) , \\left( {z}_{2} \\right)$ , and $\\left( {z}_{3} \\right)$ , respectively, then what is $\\left( {z}_{1} \\right) + \\left( {z}_{2} \\right) + \\left( {z}_{3} \\right)$ ?",
