    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: (b)</strong></p><p>Moseley's law relates the frequency of characteristic X-rays to atomic number: $\\sqrt{\\nu} = a(Z - b)$. This established that atomic number (not atomic weight) is the fundamental property of elements.</p>",
