    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: (d)</strong></p><p>For the shortest wavelength line in Balmer series: transition $n=\\infty → n=2$. $\\frac{1}{\\lambda} = R_H\\left(\\frac{1}{4} - 0\\right) = \\frac{R_H}{4}$. This gives the series limit of Balmer series.</p>",
