    "type": "subjective",
    "text": "Find the velocity $\\left( {ms}^{-1} \\right)$ of electron in first Bohr's orbit of radius ${a}_{0}$ . Also find the de-Broglie's wavelength (in m ). Find the orbital angular momentum of $2p$ orbital of hydrogen atom in units of $h/2\\pi$ .",
