    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: (a)</strong></p><p>Order of reaction = sum of powers of concentration terms in rate law. It's experimentally determined and can be 0, fractional, or integer. Molecularity = number of molecules participating in elementary step (always positive integer).</p>",
