    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "The rate constant, the activation energy and the Arrhenius parameter of a chemical reaction at ${25}^{∘}C$ are $3.0\\times {10}^{-4}{s}^{-1},104.4 kJ{mol}^{-1}$ and $6.0\\times {10}^{14}{s}^{-1}$ respectively. The value of the rate constant as $T\\rightarrow \\infty$ is",
