    "id": "jee_adv_chem_chemical_kinetics_7",
    "number": "7",
    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "Consider the chemical reaction, ${N}_{2(g)}+3{H}_{2(g)}\\rightarrow 2{NH}_{3(g)}$ . The rate of this reaction can be expressed in terms of time derivative of concentration of ${N}_{2(g)},{H}_{2(g)}$ or ${NH}_{3(g)}$ . Identify the correct relationship amongst the rate expressions.",
    "images": [],
