      "Rate $=-d \\left( {N}_{2} \\right) /dt=-3d \\left( {H}_{2} \\right) /dt=2d \\left( {NH}_{3} \\right) /dt$",
      "Rate $=d \\left( {N}_{2} \\right) /dt=-1/3d \\left( {H}_{2} \\right) /dt=1/2d \\left( {NH}_{3} \\right) /dt$",
