    "type": "subjective",
    "text": "In a first order reaction the concentration of reactant decreases from $800 mol/{dm}^{3}$ to $50 mol/{dm}^{3}$ in $2\\times {10}^{4}$ sec . The rate constant of reaction in ${sec}^{-1}$ is",
    "images": [],
    "options": [],
