    "chapter": "Chemical Kinetics",
    "topic": "Multiple Choice Questions\n (With One Correct Answer)",
    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: (c)</strong></p><p>First order: $[A] = [A_0] \\cdot 2^{-t/t_{1/2}}$. From 800 to 50: $50 = 800/2^n → 2^n = 16 → n = 4$. So 4 half-lives. $t = 4 \\times t_{1/2}$. Given total time (e.g., 2hrs = 120min), $t_{1/2} = 30$ min.</p>",
