    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "The reaction, $X\\rightarrow$ Product, follows first order kinetics. In 40 minutes the concentration of $X$ changes from 0.1 to 0.025 M . The rate of reaction, when concentration of $X$ is 0.01 M is",
    "images": [],
