    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: (d)</strong></p><p>For $aG + bH → $ products: if doubling $[G]$ doubles rate and tripling $[H]$ triples rate: Rate = $k[G][H]$. Order w.r.t. $G = 1$, order w.r.t. $H = 1$. Overall order = 2. The rate law is determined experimentally from the given data.</p>",
    "needsManualReview": false,
