    "number": "12",
    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "Under the same reaction conditions, initial concentration of $1.386 mol{dm}^{-3}$ of a substance becomes half in 40 seconds and 20 seconds through first order and zero order kinetics, respectively. Ratio ( ${k}_{1}/{k}_{0}$ ) of the rate constant for first order ( ${k}_{1}$ ) and zero order ( ${k}_{0}$ ) of the reactions is",
