    "topic": "Multiple Choice Questions\n (With One Correct Answer)",
    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: (a)</strong></p><p>From $1.386$ to $0.693$ mol/dm³ in time $t_1$. $[A_0]/[A] = 1.386/0.693 = 2 → $ this is one half-life. For first-order: $t_{1/2}$ is constant. $k = 0.693/t_1$. Use this to identify the order.</p>",
