    "number": "13",
    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "For a first order reaction $A\\rightarrow P$ , the temperature ( $T$ ) dependent rate constant $(k)$ was found to follow the equation $logk=-(2000) \\frac{1}{T} +6.0$ . The pre exponential factor $A$ and the activation energy ${E}_{a}$ , respectively, are",
