    "id": "jee_adv_chem_chemical_kinetics_15",
    "number": "15",
    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "In the reaction, $P+Q\\rightarrow R+S$ , the time taken for $75%$ reaction of $P$ is twice the time taken for $50%$ reaction of $P$ . The concentration of $Q$ varies with reaction time as shown in the figure. The overall order of the reaction is",
