    "chapter": "Chemical Kinetics",
    "topic": "Multiple Choice Questions\n (With One Correct Answer)",
    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: (d)</strong></p><p>75% completion: $[A] = 0.25[A_0]$. If $t_{75\\%} = 2 \\times t_{50\\%}$: For first order, $t_{75\\%} = 2t_{1/2}$ and $t_{50\\%} = t_{1/2}$, so ratio = 2 ✓. This confirms first-order kinetics. For first order: $t_{75\\%}/t_{50\\%}$ is always 2.</p>",
