    "type": "subjective",
    "text": "The rate constant for an isomerisation reaction, $A\\rightarrow B$ is $4.5\\times {10}^{-3}{min}^{-1}$ . If the initial concentration of $A$ is 1 M , calculate the rate of the reaction after 1 hr .",
    "images": [],
