    "chapter": "Chemical Kinetics",
    "topic": "Subjective Problems",
    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: $3.44 \\times 10^{-3}$ mol/L/min</strong></p><p>Isomerization $A → B$: $k = 4.5 \\times 10^{-3}$ min⁻¹ (first order). At equilibrium, $[B]_{eq}/[A]_{eq} = K_c$. Given initial $[A]_0$, at equilibrium the net rate = 0. But initial rate = $k[A]_0 = 4.5 \\times 10^{-3} \\times [A]_0$.</p>",
    "needsManualReview": false,
