    "text": "The rate of a first-order reaction is 0.04 mol litre ${e}^{-1}{s}^{-1}$ at 10 minutes and 0.03 mol litre ${}^{-1}{s}^{-1}$ at 20 minutes after initiation. Find the half-life of the reaction.",
