    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: (a)</strong></p><p>In BCC structure, the body diagonal = $a\\sqrt{3}$. For CsBr (BCC), $Cs^+$ is at body center, $Br^-$ at corners. Shortest interionic distance = half body diagonal = $\\frac{a\\sqrt{3}}{2} = \\frac{4.3\\sqrt{3}}{2} = 3.72$ Å.</p>",
    "reviewReasons": [
      "LETTER_ANSWER_NO_OPTIONS"
    ],
    "difficulty": "Hard"
