    "correct": "d",
    "chapter": "Solid State",
    "topic": "Multiple Choice Questions (With One Correct Answer)",
    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: (d)</strong></p><p>2D square unit cell: each corner atom shared by 4 cells → atoms/cell = $4 \\times 1/4 = 1$. If atoms touch along edge: $a = 2r$. Area of atoms = $\\pi r^2$. Area of cell = $a^2 = 4r^2$. Packing efficiency = $\\frac{\\pi r^2}{4r^2} \\times 100 = 78.54\\%$.</p>",
    "reviewReasons": [
      "LETTER_ANSWER_NO_OPTIONS"
    ],
    "difficulty": "Medium"
