    "type": "subjective",
    "text": "In a metal deficient oxide sample, ${M}_{X}{Y}_{2}{O}_{4}$ ( $M$ and $Y$ are metals), $M$ is present in both +2 and +3 oxidation states and $Y$ is in +3 oxidation state. If the fraction of ${M}^{2+}$ ions present in $M$ is $\\frac{1}{3}$ , the value of $X$ is _______ .",
