    "topic": "Solid State",
    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: 2.16 g/cm³</strong></p><p>$\\rho = \\frac{ZM}{N_A a^3}$. $Z = 4$, $M_{NaCl} = 58.5$ g/mol, $a = 0.564$ nm = $5.64 \\times 10^{-8}$ cm. $\\rho = \\frac{4 \\times 58.5}{6.023 \\times 10^{23} \\times (5.64 \\times 10^{-8})^3} = \\frac{234}{6.023 \\times 10^{23} \\times 1.794 \\times 10^{-22}} = \\frac{234}{108.0} = 2.16$ g/cm³.</p>",
    "needsManualReview": false,
