    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: (b)</strong></p><p>HCP unit cell: 12 corner atoms × 1/6 = 2, 2 face atoms × 1/2 = 1, 3 interior atoms = 3. Total = 6 atoms per HCP unit cell. These 6 atoms are arranged in ABAB pattern with each atom having coordination number 12.</p>",
